      ZLINE TYPE AUFK-ZLINE,
      END OF IT_ZLINE.

DATA: BEGIN OF IT_ZCODE OCCURS 0,
      ZCODE TYPE AUFK-ZCODE,
      END OF IT_ZCODE.

